@startuml SSD US 2.2.7 - Review Pending Vessel Visit Notifications
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: request pending Vessel Visit Notifications
activate System
System --> Officer : 1.1: list of pending notifications\n(Vessel, IMO, ETA, ETD,\npurpose, cargo, submitted by)
deactivate System
deactivate Officer

@enduml
